# Public GitVerse/bootstrap mirror URLs for CHIMERA release fallback.
#
# One URL per line. Use public bootstrap mirrors that serve a CHIMERA
# `chimera.sh` script with matching archive/checksum metadata.
#
# Official public GitVerse bootstrap mirror:
https://gitverse.ru/api/repos/ArtReg/chimera/raw/branch/main/chimera.sh
#
# Examples:
# https://gitverse.ru/<owner>/<repo>
# https://gitverse.ru/<owner>/<repo>/content/main/chimera.sh
# https://gitverse.ru/api/repos/<owner>/<repo>/raw/branch/main/chimera.sh
# https://mirror.example/chimera-pq-release.tar.gz
